{
  "name": "Armor of Magical Strength",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This armor has 6 charges. The wearer can expend the armor's charges in the following ways:</p><ul><li>When the wearer makes a Strength check or a Strength Saving Throw, it can expend 1 charge to add a bonus to the roll equal to its Intelligence modifier.</li><li>If the creature would be knocked Prone, it can use its Reaction to expend 1 charge to avoid being knocked prone.</li></ul><p>The armor regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn.</p>",
